# ---- Connected-account credentials and personal data (any depth) ----
# The backend stores Monzo/Trading212 tokens, imported transactions and friend lists under
# CREDENTIALS_DIR (default data/private, relative to services/api). Never commit them.
**/data/private/
**/data/cache/
**/credentials.json
**/monzo_history.json
**/finance_snapshot.json
**/oauth_states.json
**/social.json
